{"availability":"available","full":"manascb1344/Book-Store","name":"Book-Store","description":"This repository houses the code for a Book Store web application, featuring a dynamic React.js frontend for user interactions and a Node.js backend with MongoDB for CRUD operations. Users can manage a virtual bookstore, add/update/delete books, and explore the inventory. Contributions and issue reporting are welcome!","category":"Developer tools","language":"JavaScript","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2024-01-07T12:42:53Z","updated":"2024-01-08T14:00:49Z","branch":"main","homepage":"https://book-store-e9vo.onrender.com","topics":["backend","book-store","bug-reporting","contribution","crud","frontend","full-stack","license","live-demo","mongodb","nodejs","reactjs","web-application"],"demo":"https://book-store-e9vo.onrender.com/","color":"#63362a","ink":"#f8c7a8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T11:06:52.600Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-11T11:06:52.600Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-11T11:06:52.600Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-11T11:06:52.600Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":["React","Node.js"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Welcome to the Book Store web application! This repository contains both the frontend and backend code for a basic full-stack web app that empowers users to perform CRUD (Create, Read, Update, Delete) operations on a curated collection of books.","The Book Store web app is crafted to facilitate users in managing a virtual bookstore. It offers essential features such as adding new books, updating existing book details, deleting books, and seamlessly browsing the available inventory. The frontend leverages React.js for a dynamic and interactive user interface, while the backend, fueled by Node.js, efficiently handles data storage and retrieval using MongoDB as a robust NoSQL database."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/manascb1344/Book-Store/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"438502cd5ba4e542341a3cbb3257638f9b32bebc772fbab5